### State abfragen
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/sessions/main/state

### Kein Netz injizieren
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/sessions/main/state
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "network": {"stat": 4},
  "signal": {"rssi": 99, "ber": 99}
}

### Defekte SIM injizieren
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/sessions/main/state
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sim": {"state": "SIM_FAILURE"}
}

### URC senden
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/sessions/main/inject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "MODEM_TO_DTE",
  "data": "
+CREG: 4
"
}

### Befehl einspeisen
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/sessions/main/inject
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "direction": "DTE_TO_MODEM",
  "data": "AT+CSQ"
}
